attack-detection:AN0482 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0170#AN0482> ;
    skos:broader attack-detection:DET0170 ;
    skos:definition "Defenders may observe adversary attempts to alter or replace a network device’s operating system image through anomalous CLI commands, unexpected firmware updates, integrity check failures, or mismatches in version and checksum validation. Suspicious behavior includes modification of image files on storage, OS version output inconsistent with baselines, unexpected reloads or reboots after image replacement, and changes to boot configuration that load non-standard system images."@en ;
