    rdfs:seeAlso <https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0047> ;
    skos:definition """The process of listing or retrieving metadata about existing snapshots in a cloud environment.

*Data Collection Measures:*

- AWS CloudTrail
    - Logs API calls such as `DescribeSnapshots`, `ListSnapshots`, and `GetSnapshotAttributes`.
- Azure Monitor Logs
