attack-detection:DC0016 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0016> ;
    skos:definition "When a process or program dynamically attaches a shared library, module, or plugin into its memory space. This action is typically performed to extend the functionality of an application, access shared system resources, or interact with kernel-mode components."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/crgo/vocab/attack-detection> ;
