    skos:scopeNote "Reference detection content of ATT&CK 19.2: detection strategies (DET), the analytics they use (AN, narrower than their strategy) and data components (DC). Links: strategy 'targets technique' (ATT&CK 'detects'), strategy 'uses analytic', analytic 'analytic uses data component'. An organisation's own strategies and rules are separate records that may adapt these (crgo-siem)."@en .

